  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Locating the Assets**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the correct location for the Conexpet logo and isotype within the `img/` and `public/img/` directories. I\'ve also noted the user\'s instructions for incorporating the logo in the navigation and footer, including the CSS filter for dark mode.\n\n\n**Reviewing The Specifications**\n\nNow, I\'m meticulously reviewing the visual identity specifications. I\'m focusing on the color palette, typography, and desired style\342\200\224specifically the Apple Keynote aesthetic. The section detailing the structure and sections, particularly the preloader with its black background, logo, red progress bar, and numeric counter, are currently under close consideration. My goal is to ensure complete compliance with every visual detail.\n\n\n**Analyzing the Designs**\n\nI\'m now diving into the design specs for the navigation, hero section, and preloader. I\'ve begun to break down each element. I\'m focusing on the fixed navigation\'s transparency, background blur, and transition based on scroll position. The hero section is getting attention as well; I\'m breaking down the typewriter effect of the red eyebrow text, the overall layout of the section, and then the detailed structure of the H1, focusing on text gradients.\n\n\n**Deconstructing the H1**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the hero section\'s H1. I\'m deep diving into the text formatting. I have noted the dynamic red gradient for the text, with its animated background-position, and the specified font size, weight, tracking, and line-height. I\'m also ensuring the subtitle\'s color, max-width, and centering are precisely incorporated. I am meticulously analyzing the \"Real operation badge\", and the requirements for the two buttons. Finally, I\'m noting the scroll indicator\'s design.\n\n\n**Incorporating Company History**\n\nI\'ve just incorporated the company history, emphasizing its Ecuadorian roots and the pivotal role of the Andes. I\'ve also integrated three animated counter stats reflecting \"15+ a\303\261os,\" \"500+ clientes,\" and \"98% entregas a tiempo,\" triggering on scroll. I\'m leveraging an ease-out cubic animation over 2 seconds.\n\nI\'ve also moved to the \'Servicios\' section, creating a 2x2 grid. I\'m populating it with four service cards: Heavy Cargo Transport with a truck icon, Integral Logistics & Vacuum Fluids with a package icon, Route & Lifting Consulting using an ascending graph, and National Coverage & Workshops represented by a target icon. The content for each has been drafted and I am finalizing the copy.\n\n\n**Detailing the Cards**\n\nI\'m now detailing each service card\'s visual characteristics. I\'m focusing on the subtle `rgba(255,255,255,0.02)` background and the animated hover states. I\'m prioritizing the border-radius, red border on hover, `translateY(-4px)` effect, and the animated red gradient line at the top. I\'m also planning the red translucent category tag pill and the animated red laser line effect around the card borders, I\'ll use `@keyframes borderTravel` for that.\n\n**Designing the Coverage Section**\n\nI\'m presently focused on the Cobertura section. I\'ve broken down the design into a 2-column grid. I\'m sketching the visual elements for the left side: I\'m planning 3 concentric rings with decreasing red opacity. I\'m placing 4 pulsing red radar nodes representing key cities. The animation will be handled by the `ringPulse` keyframe. I\'m also incorporating a stylized vector map of Ecuador. On the right side, I\'m composing the heading and explaining the fleet\'s reach. I\'m also adding 4 main routes with a vertical red guide line and cities.\n\n\n**Defining the Fleet**\n\nI\'m now detailing the fleet section, specifically the visual representation of each vehicle type. I\'m focusing on the \"Plataformas,\" \"Contenedores,\" and \"Tanques & Vacuum\" items, each with distinct geometric shapes and hover animations. I\'ve noted the specifications for each and the smooth rotation effect on hover.\n\n\n**Formulating the Quote Form**\n\nI\'m now implementing the interactive quote form for the \'Contacto\' section. I\'m focusing on the required fields: full name, email, phone number, and a service type selector. I\'m noting the estimated route input and space for detailed requirements, including a full-width red submit button.\n\\n\\n\n**Structuring the Footer**\n\nI\'m structuring the four-column footer, focusing on the Conexpet brand, navigation links, services & specialties, and intranet links, including the copyright at the bottom, which is all now complete. I\'ve also detailed the required background geometric figures.\n\n\n**Defining Geometric Shapes**\n\nI\'m now detailing the footer\'s background, creating fixed geometric shapes. I\'m noting specific characteristics of shapes, their opacity, colors, and gradients, as well as the transition effects which are to take place when a user navigates to various sections.\n\n\n**Implementing Refinements**\n\nI\'m now implementing additional enhancements. I\'ve integrated a subtle parallax effect with varying scroll speeds for geometric shapes. An SVG `<feTurbulence>` filter with 3.5% opacity is providing a cinematic grain overlay. I\'m building a custom cursor, a red dot with an expanding ring, and a full-screen red flash on section changes. A vertical red scroll progress bar is in place, and buttons will have a magnetic effect on hover. Also in the hero and contact sections, I\'ve added \"Operaciones 24/7 \342\200\224 Lunes a Domingo\". I\'m also adding micro-interactions to the service cards, and the typewriter effect is now implemented, as well as the dynamic red gradient in the Hero H1. Lastly, the WhatsApp floating button is in.\n\n\n**Verifying File Structure**\n\nI\'m now confirming the project\'s file structure. I\'m focusing on the `index.html`, `style.css`, and `script.js` files, ensuring they are referenced correctly. Also, I\'m checking to confirm no unnecessary frameworks such as React are being implemented, per the instructions.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 10
      nanos: 797803921
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
