  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Architecture**\n\nOkay, I\'ve got a solid grasp of the codebase. Now, I\'m moving on to building the definitive architecture. First up, I\'m prioritizing light mode, aiming for that clean, white-page experience as the foundation. Then I will be applying the ability to change to dark mode.\n\n\n**Implementing the Toggle**\n\nMy focus has shifted to the theme toggle. I\'m implementing a default light mode with a white background and cool gray dividers, paired with a dark mode offering obsidian dark and slate backgrounds. I\'m building a theme toggle with sun/moon icons and a smooth rotation effect, to be present in both desktop and mobile views. To prevent any jarring theme flashes, I\'m pre-initializing the theme using an inline script within the `index.html` file.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Design**\n\nI\'m now picturing the interface. I\'m leaning towards impactful typography, specifically *Inter Tight* in bold for key phrases, really emphasizing power. I\'m incorporating a dynamic, animated subtitle that rotates through service offerings. I\'m also visualizing authoritative sub-headlines to convey our expertise. Finally, I\'m considering dual CTAs with animated arrows and direct links, plus an emergency dispatch indicator to provide the client quick response information.\n\n\n**Constructing the Core**\n\nI\'m now integrating a four-pillar interactive matrix in the hero section, featuring interactive cards for the four core divisions. Each will include quick specs upon hover. Following that, I\'m constructing a real-time animated stats counter bar to showcase key company metrics.\n\nI\'m gathering the full content from the old website to build the about and governance sections, including history, mission, vision, values, and certifications.\n\n\n**Detailing the Services**\n\nI\'m now detailing the specialized services section. Specifically, I\'m working on the four pillars, which will feature in-depth technical sheets. I\'m focusing on the specifics for: 1) Fluid Transport via Vacuum (tankers, fluids, etc.); 2) Heavy Haulage (rigs, pipes, containers); 3) Industrial Lifting (cranes, certified rigging); and 4) Waste Management & Environmental Compliance, ISO 14001 (Gesti\303\263n Ambiental), ISO 45001 (Seguridad y Salud en el Trabajo), and the Zero Accidents policy.\n\n\n**Expanding the Offerings**\n\nI\'m now detailing more specialized services. I\'m focusing on critical lifting plans with soil calculation engineering and load radii. I\'m also including specialized workshops and maintenance in Lago Agrio. Additionally, each service will include an interactive \"View Full Technical Sheet\" button that opens a modal with detailed specifications and a checklist.\n\nI\'m now creating a vehicle fleet section, an interactive catalog with filters and technical sheets, with filters for different vehicle types. I\'m also incorporating a logistics radar and national coverage section, an interactive map of Ecuador showing the 5 hubs and 4 main corridors, and finally a route calculator. I will also be including an intranet and corporate portals section.\n\n\n**Integrating Key Resources**\n\nI\'m now integrating essential resources. I\'m focusing on incorporating HR tools, including competency evaluations and permit requests. I\'ll include health surveys for drivers and mechanics. Furthermore, I\'ll ensure I implement sections for Operations and Finance, including Oracle ERP, Hesk helpdesk, and a supplier portal. Finally, I\'ll integrate an ethical conduct channel.\n\n\n\n**Defining the Interface**\n\nI\'m now detailing the user interface elements. I\'m focusing on interactive modals for detailed technical sheets and quick quotes. I will establish a comprehensive footer including legal data and a sitemap. Also, a floating WhatsApp button with an \"online 24/7\" badge is planned. My priority is to prepare `style.css`. I\'m building a light mode with white, gray, graphite, slate, and red. Dark mode with obsidian, card opacity, white, gray, and red. I\'ll include smooth transitions and elevated card borders.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 20
      nanos: 472707296
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
