    thinking: "**Analyzing HTML Structure**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the HTML structure within `index.html`. My main goal is to establish a robust foundation for the website\'s visual presentation. I\'m prioritizing light mode as the default, implemented with an immediate script. The aim is a clean, modern layout in the Swiss/Editorial style.\n\n\n**Defining Visual Elements**\n\nI\'ve been thinking about specific visual components. The logo, sourced from `img/logo.png`, will have its crisp original colors in light mode and a clean contrast filter in dark mode using the `brand-logo-img` class. I\'ve also outlined the structure for a top status ticker, a comprehensive navigation bar with key links, and the elements for a dynamic hero section featuring live telemetry.\n\n\n**Developing Hero Section Content**\n\nI\'m now deep in the details of the hero section. I\'ve formulated the dynamic kinetic subtitle, the core descriptor, and two action buttons: \"Solicitar Cotizaci\303\263n Inmediata\" and \"L\303\255nea Operativa 24/7.\" I\'ve also drafted a \"Fast Dispatch Guarantee\" badge. I am structuring the floating 4-Pillar Interactive Matrix with cards covering fluids, heavy cargo, crane services, and the Lago Agrio base, all to showcase core competencies. Also considering the placement and style of high-impact stats.\n\n\n**Structuring Company Information**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"La Empresa & Acreditaciones\" section, emphasizing our history in Lago Agrio and our HSE-focused mission. I\'m showcasing our triple ISO certification and commitment to a \"Cero Accidentes\" policy. Also, I\'ve outlined the \"Servicios Especializados\" with technical sheets, and the \"Flota de Veh\303\255culos\" section including live filters.\n\n\n**Expanding Fleet & Coverage**\n\nI\'m now focusing on detailing the operational capabilities. I\'m structuring a \"Flota de Veh\303\255culos\" section, specifying our Lowboy, Cama Cuna, and Vacuum Tanker capabilities, alongside a \"Radar Log\303\255stico y Cobertura Nacional\" section. This will feature an interactive map of Ecuador highlighting key locations and calculating distances, along with interactive breakdowns of our logistics corridors. I am also working on an Intranet & Portales Corporativos section, and a \"Cotizador Inteligente en Vivo.\"\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
