          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <!-- Pregunta 1 -->"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <div class=\"faq-item open\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <button type=\"button\" class=\"faq-header focus:outline-none\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <span>\302\277Qu\303\251 permisos especiales gestiona CONEXPET para transporte extrapesado?</span>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 faq-icon flex-shrink-0 ml-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              </svg>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            </button>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <div class=\"faq-body\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              Gestionamos de manera integral los salvoconductos y autorizaciones del Ministerio de Transporte y Obras P\303\272blicas (MTOP) para cargas que superan las dimensiones y pesos est\303\241ndar reglamentarios, incluyendo la coordinaci\303\263n de veh\303\255culos escolta privados y apoyo policial cuando la ruta lo requiera."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <!-- Pregunta 2 -->"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <div class=\"faq-item\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <button type=\"button\" class=\"faq-header focus:outline-none\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <span>\302\277Qu\303\251 p\303\263lizas de seguro respaldan las operaciones y la carga transportada?</span>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 faq-icon flex-shrink-0 ml-3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "                <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              </svg>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            </button>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <div class=\"faq-body\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "              Todas nuestras unidades operan bajo p\303\263lizas de responsabilidad civil extracontractual y seguros de transporte de carga con cobertura ante accidentes, volcamiento, robo o da\303\261o ambiental de hasta $500.000 USD por evento, ampliables seg\303\272n el valor comercial del equipo del cliente."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          </div>"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <!-- Pregunta 3 -->"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "          <div class=\"faq-item\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "            <button type=\"button\" class=\"faq-header focus:outline-none\">"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
